2D · ROTATIONconstrainRotation locks a box's orientation

By default, pack2D will rotate boxes 90° if that helps them fit. Set constrainRotation: true on any box to require it stay in the given orientation — useful for items with a defined ‘up’.

↻ Reshuffle
// Same box (30×80) into a 100×40 bin.
// Without the flag: pack2D rotates it to fit.
// With constrainRotation: true: locked orientation → unfit.

pack2D({
  bins: [{ width: 100, height: 40 }],
  boxes: [{ width: 30, height: 80, constrainRotation: true }],
});
