3D · QUICK STARTpack3D — cuboids into containers

Same shape as pack2D but with depth and weight. Items are rotated freely across all 6 orientations to find a fit. Weight is enforced per bin via maxWeight.

↻ Reshuffle
import { pack3D } from 'binpackingjs/3d';

const result = pack3D({
  bins: [{
    name: 'Small Box',
    width: 296, height: 296, depth: 8,
    maxWeight: 1000,
  }],
  items: [
    { name: 'Item 1', width: 250, height: 250, depth: 2, weight: 200 },
    { name: 'Item 2', width: 250, height: 250, depth: 2, weight: 200 },
    { name: 'Item 3', width: 250, height: 250, depth: 2, weight: 200 },
  ],
});

result.packedBins[0].items.length; // 3
result.unfitItems.length;           // 0
